  "aiDesignerPrompt": "Create an iPhone child health overview screen for PillPath in Russian. Use a warm pastel peach/cream background, soft white cards, coral accents, dark navy typography, rounded minimal icons in pastel circles, and a soft 3D child avatar. The screen should feel like a calm care dashboard, not a technical data table. Main structure: top back link and action buttons, large title 'Обзор · Эдик', subtitle, large summary card 'Главное за 7 дней' with key insights on the left and child avatar on the right, three quick insight cards, segmented tabs 'Лента / Календарь / Графики', filter chips, event timeline, and floating bottom navigation. Use generous spacing, rounded corners, 1pt peach borders, subtle shadow, and clear hierarchy."
